# No AI commit or PR attribution

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`, `Made-with: Cursor`, `Made with Cursor`, `Co-Authored-By` AI trailers, or generated-by signatures to commits or pull requests.

- Do not pass `--trailer` with Cursor or other AI attribution on `git commit`
- Preserve genuine human co-authors only
- Prefer commits whose message body contains only the intended human-authored text
